# Each activation of The Mycosynth Gardens has its own X (CR 107.3k), and a target of it is judged with that X wherever it
# is judged (CR 115.7a, 608.2b), not with the X of another activation of the same land above it. Bot1 activates the Gardens
# with X = 1 at Sol Ring (Gold Pan, mana value 2, refused), untaps it with Candelabra of Tawnos, and activates it again with
# X = 2 at Gold Pan (the mana value 1 artifacts refused). Bot2 casts Bolt Bend on the lower activation, the X = 1 one: its
# other legal targets are Bot1's other nontoken artifacts of mana value 1, Candelabra of Tawnos and Expedition Map, and not
# Gold Pan, which the X = 2 activation above it would allow; Bot2 picks Expedition Map. The X = 2 activation resolves first
# (the Gardens becomes a Gold Pan), then the X = 1 one, its new target still legal at X = 1: the Gardens ends a copy of
# Expedition Map, tapped from the second activation, beside the untapped original.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Mycosynth Gardens
Candelabra of Tawnos
Mox Jet
Expedition Map
Island
Sol Ring
Gold Pan
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bolt Bend
Island x15

